		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010040a"},
		line=455,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Letting out a soundless scream, Akari suddenly bolts upright.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Sweat is gushing from her brow, and her shoulders are trembling.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"She turns to look at me, a startled look on her face.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sou... jin?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"She moves her lips slowly, as though to confirm each individual sound.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was sinking in the river...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori apparently pulled you up.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou did?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Akari looks around.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh... I was just dreaming.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank goodness...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How are you feeling?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Akari moves around different parts of her body to check her condition.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think I'm fine.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank goodness...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"I breath a sigh of relief and pour her a cup of lukewarm tea.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Akari takes the teacup with both hands and gingerly drinks it little by little.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is everything fine with your body?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not the slightest problem.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Really? Then all my effort was totally worth it.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I straighten my posture even as Akari beams at me.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It is most shameful for a warrior to lose consciousness.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I hold my wakizashi out in front of me with both hands.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's with that? Don't you sour my mood by disemboweling yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Akari forcefully sets down her teacup.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I saved you because I didn't want you to die. Got it?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But, what I've done is truly inexcusable.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's what you think, then don't you dare collapse in front of me again.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-You nearly gave me a heart attack, you know! Have some sympathy for your lord!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"The last I remember of the previous night is right up to when the Republican Army found us.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"After that, Akari apparently carried us while braving a hail of bullets and managed to leap into the river.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Even in the face of such mortal danger, she never breathed a single word of reproach.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I shall retrain myself from the ground up that I might never disgrace myself again.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, aren't you motivated...”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I saved your life and all, you know. Can't you be a bit more grateful?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're making me feel like I wronged you somehow...”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm grateful from the bottom of my heart that you saved me. That much is true.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“However, I would ask you this.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why didn't you leave me behind?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Akari freezes where she sits.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"The cheerfulness instantly drains from her expression.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What, it's a problem that I went and saved you?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You ought to have left me behind and escaped yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“One wrong move, and you and Kotone both would've died.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What sort of thing is that to say to the person who saved your life?!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you even have any idea how I felt lugging you around?!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Akari punctuates each question by slamming the tatami with her hands.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"It's only natural that she'd get angry.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"But as her vassal, this is an objection I absolutely must voice.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know how you felt. That's why I'm asking.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why would you not abandon your vassal who was only holding you back?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you were to die, the world itself may as well end!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Because I wanted to save you! How is that even a question?!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you saying I should leave the people I care about to die just to save my own skin?!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is the rightful choice.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Silence!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if it is rightful, I refuse to be the sort of person who'd make that choice!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Akari glares at me.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ever since you saved my life during the war, I've always been chasing after you...”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only thing that got me through all my training was the thought that you'd be disappointed in me if I gave up.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The source of my strength... it's always been you.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And so I'd never leave you to die, not in a million years.\nCan't you see that?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So that's the way you think of me...”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"She self-consciously wrings her hands in front of her chest.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“S-So what if it is?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who cares? I'll think what I want about you...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"She looks downwards, her cheeks flushed.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"I'm happy she feels that way, but...",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Such needless affection ought not exist between lord and servant.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I cannot trust a lord who would err as a result of indulging in such indiscretions.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Akari's face is ablaze with equal parts shame and indignation.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors put our very lives on the line to fight for our\nlord's sake.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if the enemy of our lord were a bosom friend or a cherished lover, we would not hesitate to cut them down.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so, it is unpardonable that our lords should waver in their resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Know that so long as you proceed with an iron will, I shall bear no grudge no matter where, no matter when I am killed or forsaken!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I fix my gaze firmly on Akari as I speak.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ours is but to do and die, but lords have a duty all their own.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You must come to understand that.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How can I possibly understand that?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Akari says, barely above a whisper, before diving under her futon.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let me rest a little.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Get out of here. Now.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Leaving it there, I stand up.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm glad you're safe.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you for saving me.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm very glad to be able to see you once again.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"In lieu of a reply, Akari rolls over in her futon.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(What the heck, you jerk?)”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
